return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'将此站点的媒体库移动到 Zinn® 对象存储并通过 CDN 进行分发。从您的 Zinn® 仪表盘进行配置 — 无需在 WordPress 中输入任何访问密钥。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已存储。键入新值以替换它。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有任何内容符合该筛选条件。','Add a row'=>'添加一行','Remove this row'=>'移除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Copied'=>'已复制','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此站点上的每个 Zinn® 插件，以及它是否正常工作。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要任何连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认值','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将此插件的所有设置恢复为默认值。要继续吗？','Diagnostics for support'=>'用于支持的诊断信息','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件从不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥 — 您需要在新站点上重新输入这些内容。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件上的所有设置均已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件过大，无法作为设置导出文件。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从其他插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在此处导入它将保存该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 项设置。密码和 API 密钥绝不会包含在导出文件中，因此请重新输入。','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 未返回令牌。此站点未进行任何更改。','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'本站点已不再连接至Zinn®媒体卸载。新上传的文件将保留在此服务器上。请从您的Zinn Digital®仪表盘重新配对。','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® 返回了 HTTP %d。','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'已由 Zinn Digital® 断开连接。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有需要注意的事项','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(在新标签页中打开)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'将此发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'将要发送的正是这些内容——没有其他内容，也没有任何隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们为您打开支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请复制上方内容并自行粘贴到工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'我们无法从此服务器（%s）连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 — 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 参考编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多份报告。请等待几分钟后再试 — 之前发送的报告已送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接收报告——这是我们这边的问题，而非您的问题。请稍后重试，或将上述报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告已被拒绝（HTTP %d）。请复制上方内容并提交工单，同时附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'用于 WordPress 的 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移，以及专为管理多个网站的用户打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和链接位置，资金安全托管，直至买卖双方均感到满意。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的专业人士','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作者、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目让他们竞标。','Media Offload'=>'媒体分流','Connection'=>'连接','What gets moved'=>'迁移的内容','How media is served'=>'媒体资源分发方式','Move a batch now'=>'立即移动批次','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'已移动的媒体绝不会受到此处更改的影响——其地址不会改变。','New uploads'=>'最新上传','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'新上传的内容到达后立即移至 Zinn® 存储','Existing media'=>'现有媒体','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'继续移动已在此处的媒体库','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'在后台每小时处理几个文件，从上次中断处继续。关闭此选项会将其暂停；已移动的内容不会恢复。','Files per hourly pass'=>'每小时批次的文件数','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'每个附件都包含多个文件，且每个文件都是一次完整上传。若主机速度较快且执行限制较宽松，请调高此值；若处理过程经常提前中断，请调低此值。','Leave files smaller than'=>'保留小于以下大小的文件：','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'千字节。一个微小的图标在额外连接上的开销往往大于其节省的磁盘空间，因此很少有理由去移动它。设置为 0 以移动所有内容。','Never move these types'=>'切勿移动这些类型','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'当插件直接从磁盘读取文件时很有用 — 字体、表单构建器盖章的 PDF、播放器在其中跳转定位的音频文件。','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'这两个需要特别注意——请在更改之前阅读各项说明。','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'从 Zinn® 存储提供','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'将图像和文件地址指向 Zinn® 存储','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'关闭时，文件已上传但仍由此服务器提供服务 — 这是在您检查所有内容均已完整到达时的安全状态。开启时，访客将从存储空间获取内容，且此服务器将停止承载流量。','Free the disk space'=>'释放磁盘空间','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'上传所有尺寸后，删除本地副本','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'这就是分流卸载的核心目的，而且这也是不可逆转的环节。在启用“Serve from Zinn® storage”并检查完您的网站之前，请保持此项处于关闭状态 — 如果遗漏了任何内容，本地副本是唯一的补救手段。','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'从此屏幕中删除本地副本后将无法撤消。请先进行备份 — Zinn® Connector 插件可以为您完成此操作。','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'此站点尚未连接到 Zinn® 存储，因此没有可以移动媒体文件的位置。','%d attachment moved.'=>'已移动 %d 个附件。','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'此站点未连接到 Zinn® 存储。','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'一切正常 — 只是尚未配对。在此之前，媒体文件将保留在此服务器上。','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'已连接，但上次上传失败。','Try a batch now'=>'立即尝试批量处理','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'已连接。所有附件均已移动。','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'已连接。%2$s 个附件中仍有 %1$s 个在此服务器上。','Moved so far'=>'目前已移动','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s 个文件，%2$s','Still on this server'=>'仍在此服务器上','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'第 %1$s 个附件，共 %2$s 个','Served from'=>'提供来源','this server'=>'此服务器','Connect this site'=>'连接此站点','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'打开您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板，选择此站点，打开 Files & databases，然后在 Images & video CDN 下按“Get a pairing code”。将代码粘贴在下方。','Pairing code'=>'配对码','Disconnect this site'=>'断开此站点连接','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'新上传的文件将保留在此服务器上。已移动的媒体文件仍可正常使用 — 其地址不会更改。','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'您没有权限管理此站点。','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'粘贴来自您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘的配对代码。','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'已连接。从现在起，新上传的内容将存储在 Zinn Digital®，您现有的媒体将在后台移动。','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'已断开连接。已移动的媒体文件仍可正常使用；新上传的文件将保留在此服务器上。','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'无法从此服务器读取该文件，因此未上传任何内容。','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'此站点无法流式传输上传，因此未发送任何内容。','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'该文件大小为 %1$s，且此站点的 PHP 未启用 cURL，因此可上传的最大文件为 %2$s。','The upload could not be completed.'=>'上传未能完成。','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'存储空间拒绝了上传 (HTTP %d)。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。下方的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'保持此项处于关闭状态，预设将按原样使用。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供此更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以访问 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务 (%s) 下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性检查，未被安装。']];